# Words & packs

- Playable cards: ≤16 chars, ≤2 words (`src/services/cardText.ts`).
- Themed packs live in `src/data/packs/` (`home|food|travel|nature`) with `en`/`ru`/`de` arrays (≥200 each).
- Wire new packs through `themedPacks.ts`, `WordPack`, `normalizeWordPack`, `packCatalog`, and `pack.<id>.*` i18n keys (en+ru+de).
- UI locale ≠ word language; do not overload `gameSettings.language` for UI.
- TS 3.5: avoid `import type` for runtime imports.
